{"v":4,"catch":"Kholat是一款以真實發生的「迪亞特洛夫事件」為基礎，具備恐怖要素的探索冒險遊戲。","desc":"9名俄羅斯登山客離奇死亡，讓無數的假說因此誕生。玩家為了調查實際發生的事，踏入廣大無垠的烏拉山脈。探險時碰到的神祕情況，或許會多得超乎您的想像……\n\n遊戲特色：\n*由西恩賓（Sean Bean）擔任旁白解說\n*沈浸式探索體驗\n*恐怖的氛圍及緊張感\n*基於真實事件的故事\n*完全自由的開放世界\n*高難度探索\n*用地圖和羅盤在遊戲內導航\n*搭載 Unreal Engine 4\n*估計遊戲時間：4-6小時","publisher":"Phoenixx","release":"2020-09-17","genres":["冒險","模擬","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 6.2GB / Switch 6.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5247a574c3b10cc56ae11cad6c900daede63ece1a2cf880bcfb042e5d0660bd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c267490386f1d9b753025593f56cf8422a37559e665dfa75ace4e18bdce28356.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca8454cca296ab53d299304699877e331d9f367186ae7647157c8c3c96d78cf1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7abbb9514798d3abf08c47ef90f32c316cced717f8d6f5cd511019ef9a556ab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3cc80d528fa7a7f8c5fce43f434c63d26804f57a9160867b6165416609f4f0de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b7ee1162aeccf40274f8f1c31a8b3f4a9ad6202649e09a506e1850c8f59a4e28.jpg"],"titleId":"01002ca012926000","dlc":[]}